{
  "sourceLanguage" : "zh-Hans",
  "strings" : {
    " 下方保留上次可读内容，可能已过期。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : " The last readable content is shown below and may be out of date."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上一执行实例的清理未确认，不能建立新连接。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cleanup of the previous instance is unconfirmed. A new connection cannot be started."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上次运行已中断。仅恢复历史和草稿，没有恢复推理或执行队列。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The previous run was interrupted. History and drafts were restored. Inference and queued tasks were not resumed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "交互回复结果不明，请停止任务并核对运行时状态。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The interaction reply could not be confirmed. Stop the task and check the runtime status."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仍有未完成的控制请求，不能确认停止。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A control request is still pending. The stop cannot be confirmed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会话列表已刷新。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The session list was refreshed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会话发现失败，现有索引和源历史保持不变。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Could not discover sessions. The index and source history were kept."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会话尚未连接。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The session is not connected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会话尾部尚未写完，请稍后重新读取。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The session file is still being written. Reload it later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会话已不可用。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The session is no longer available."
          }
        }
