    },
    "同一会话 ID 对应多个文件，请保留唯一来源后刷新。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Multiple files share a session ID. Keep one source file and refresh."
